  "description": "For comfort and performance, the All Road's seat can be adjusted between 51 and 58 degrees.\n\nThe All Road's rear suspension features a highly progressive travel path combined with a custom spring rate and sophisticated damping for a perfect balance of performance and comfort. Up front, the All Road uses our patented anti-dive suspension spindles to take the edge off.\n\nThe fun and ease-of-use of the standard All Road with the added spark of the latest in electric assist systems from industry leader Bosch. The result is an All Road with the perfect combination of maximum efficiency, comfort and riding enjoyment. The efficient and versatile Performance Line (Class 1) electric-assist drive mated to a 1x10 Microshift drivetrain provides dynamic performance – guaranteeing an authentic riding sensation with minimal pedaling resistance. It delivers active and sporty acceleration even at low cadences, offering powerful assistance as soon as you step on the pedals. In addition, the system’s multi-sensor technology and fast information processing ensure optimum interaction between you and your eCAT. The All Road eCAT is made with Bosch components and meets or exceeds all current safety standards and is UL2849 certified.\n\nThe Bosch BES3 Smart System underpins the latest generation of Catrike eCATs. The updated system delivers increased torque, reduced weight, and improved power-to-weight performance. At the center of the system is the Bosch Performance Line drive unit, which produces up to 75 Nm of maximum torque and provides up to 340% assistance, 250W of continuous output, and up to 600W of maximum power. The Generation 5 drive unit is lightweight and compact, improving overall power-to-weight performance while providing additional torque for climbing and acceleration. The motor and boom also integrate the Bosch drive system more efficiently into the Catrike platform. The BES3 Smart System continues to provide communication between the motor, battery, and display interface. Through the Bosch eBike Flow app, the system supports software updates, customizable assistance modes, personalized display configurations, system diagnostics, performance data, and smartphone-based anti-theft functions.",
